    <releaseNotes>
			version:4.13.0
--------------

*December, 2025*

New Year update for OpenCV 4.x has been released.

- CVBenchmark
    - An unbiased CPU benchmark by OpenCV (https://github.com/opencv/cvbenchmark) that provides an evaluation of different CPUs in real-world computer vision and AI workloads is released.

- Core module:
    - Modified Input/OutputArray methods to handle 'std::vector&lt;T&gt;' or 'std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;T&gt;&gt;' in more accurate way [#28242](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28242)
    - Made `cuda::GpuMatND` compatible with InputArray/OutputArray [#23913](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/23913)
    - Forced output type for empty  matrices where it's defined in API [#27972](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27972)
    - Added `std::vector` length check Input/OutputArray [#27817](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27817)
    - Added 16-bit LUT and corresponding HAL entrypoint [#27890](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27890), [#27911](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27911)
    - Add `cv::Mat::copyAt` for for ROI operation [#27318](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27318)
    - Extended JSON support in cv::FileStorage: `null` parsing [#27579](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27579) and
    - Added support parsing null in JSON parser in cv::FileStorage [#27579](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27579) and back slash "\" support [#27587](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27587)
    - Fixed `cv::solveCubic` numerical instability via coefficient normalization [#28117](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28117)
    - Fixed tempfile race condition on Windows [#28087](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28087)
    - Restore parallel framework name on failure attempt [#27802](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27802)
    - Dropped OPENCV_FOR_OPENMP_DYNAMIC_DISABLE environment variable in favor of standard OMP_DYNAMIC [#28122](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28122)
    - Enabled fp16 conversions, but disabled NEON FP16 arithmetics on Windows for ARM [#27897](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27897)
    - Fixed dot product accumulation causing NORM test failures on Windows ARM64 [#28211](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28211)
    - Added several performance optimizations for Windows on ARM: [#27575](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27575), [#27596](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27596)
    - Fixed missing vec_cvfo on IBM POWER9 due to unavailable VSX float64 conversion [#27990](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27990)
    - Fix in-place flip in HAL for RISC-V RVV [#28180](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28180)
    - Added inRange HAL entry point [#27854](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27854)
    - Disabled IPP with AVX512 in cv::compare because of performance regression [#28311](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28311)

- Imgproc module:
    - Added Iterative Phase Correlation [#28146](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28146), [paper](https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.3847/1538-4365/ab63d7)
    - Added `cv::minEnclosingConvexPolygon` [#27369](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27369)
    - Improved near-zero convexity handling in `cv::convexHull` [#28043](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28043)
    - Kept `cv::convexHull` output indices monotone if possible [#28163](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28163)
    - Fixed overflow in connected components [#27582](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27582)
    - Corrected `cv::minAreaRect` to follow documentation (force angle to range [-90, 0)) [#28051](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28051)
    - Increased minAreaRect accuracy with doubles [#28149](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28149)
    - Added `cv::CLAHE::BitShift` option [#28014](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28014)
    - Fixed `cv::minEnclosingCircle` [#27904](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27904), [#27914](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27914)
    - Fixed standard `cv::HoughLines` output shift for rho. [#27992](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27992)
    - Fixed LINE_4/LINE_8 swap in `cv::drawContours` [#28088](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28088)
    - Fixed bug in approxPolyDP: calculate distance to a segment, not to a line [#28119](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28119)
    - Various performance optimizations for Gaussian Blur, including AVX512 [#27795](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27795) and blur [#27822](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27822), bilateralFilter [#27433](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27433).
    - Added CV_SIMD_SCALABLE branch to pointSetBoundingRect [#27479](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27479)
    - Added Canny, Scharr and Sobel for riscv-rvv hal [#27378](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27378)
    - Optimized `ThickLine()` for distant points [#27366](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27366)
    - Fixed heap-buffer-overflow in stackBlur [#28233](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28233) [#28250](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28250)
    - Fixed the out-of-bounds read in cv::bilateralFilter for 32f images [#28259](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28259)
    - Fixed memory leak in ipp_warp function [#27532](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27532)
    - Set limitation to IPP Bilateral Filter tiles number to avoid too small tiles [#27720](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27720)
    - Fixed incorrect implementation of multi-threaded call for warp perspective in IPP HAL [#27903](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27903)
    - Added stateless HAL for filters and morphology [#28208](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28208)

- Imgcodecs module:
    - Extended metadata support in Jpeg (ICCP and XMP) [#27583](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27583), PNG and WebP [#27503](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27503), cICP field in PNG [#27741](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27741), AVIF (XMP) [#27506](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27506), [#28072](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28072).
    - Added OpenEXR multispectral read/write support [#27485](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27485)
    - Added strict validation for encoding parameters [#27621](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27621), [#27769](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27769)
    - Relaxed decoding size limit to over 1 GiB for several formats [#27811](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27811), [#27976](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27976)
    - Added `IMWRITE_PNG_ZLIBBUFFER_SIZE` option support for PNG [#27551](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27551), [#27615](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27615)
    - Fixed memory leak in WebP backend [#27849](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27849)
    - Added workaround for image flipping bug in older GDAL FITS drivers [#27919](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27919)
    - Added support for 32bpp BMP with BI_BITFIELDS [#27559](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27559)
    - Fixed several overflow and out-of-bound access issues in BMP [#28040](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28040), [#27847](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27847)
    - Fixed potential crashes in PNG found by fuzzer. Namely 429429085, 429645379, 430091585 [#27529](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27529)
    - Fixed several potential overflows and error handling mistakes in PNG [#28249](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28249), [#28196](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28196), 27750
    - Fixed alpha handling for blending in PNG format [#27981](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27981)
    - Set `matrixCoefficients` to `UNSPECIFIED` for monochrome images in AVIF [#28065](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28065)
    - Added safety checks for AVIF decoder and encoder [#28200](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28200)

- VideoIO module:
    - Added option to open camera device by index through FFmpeg [#27841](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27841), Added FFmpeg 8.0 support [#27691](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27691), [#27746](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27746)
    - Extended Orbbec SDK support: added timestamps [#27610](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27610), options for custom fps and resolution [#27629](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27629), camera distortion coefficients as API [#27663](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27663)
    - Extended Aravis SDK support: allowed system-wide installation of SDK [#28090](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28090), set default pixel format for cameras with unsupported format [#28086](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28086)
    - Added macOS support for Orbbec Gemini330 camera [#27930](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27930)
    - Fixed frame seeking with negative DTS values in FFMPEG backend [#27878](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27878)
    - Fixed CvCapture_FFMPEG::setProperty(CAP_PROP_POS_*) followed by getProperty [#27523](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27523)
    - Added Raspberry Pi 4 and 5 V4L2 Stateless HEVC Hardware Acceleration with FFmpeg [#27453](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27453)
    - Optimized FFmpeg VideoCapture with swscale threads option [#27755](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27755)
    - Fix return code from CvVideoWriter_FFMPEG::writeFrame() when encapsulating [#](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/)[#27737](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27737)
    - Added OPENCV_FFMPEG_SKIP_LOG_CALLBACK to preserve custom FFmpeg logging [#27864](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27864)
    - Get code to compile without FFMPEG's libavdevice [#27948](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27948)
    - catch _com_error exceptions to suppress debugger flooding [#28073](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28073)
    - Fixed picture_sw object leak in ffmpeg backend with hardware codecs. [#28283](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28283)
    - videoio(dshow): Fix incorrect mapping for White Balance Temperature (`CAP_PROP_WB_TEMPERATURE`) property [#28202](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28202)
    - Fixes a crash on iOS when calling `VideoWriter::release()` in OpenCV 4.12.0 [#28173](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28173).

- Features2D module:
    - Fixed ORB inconsistency for masks with values differs from 255 [#26366](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/26366)
    - Fixed pointer arithmetic in BRISK corner traversal [#28091](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28091)
    - Added heuristic to allocate buffer for FAST features depending on input image resolution [#27657](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27657)
    - Optimized AGAST for Windows on ARM [#27776](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27776)
    - Added FAST to RISC-V RVV HAL [#27391](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27391)

- Objdetect module:
    - Added pixel-based confidence in ArUco marker detection [#23190](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/23190)
    - Improved multiple QR codes detection with QRCodeDetector::detectAndDecodeMulti [#27787](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27787)
    - Fixed to prevent QR code decoding from throwing on degenerate source points [#27837](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27837)
    - Fix QRCodeDetector::detectAndDecode crash in case of inconsistent detection [#27877](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27877)
    - Remove floating point arithmetic from angle computation in QR codes [#28157](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28157)
    - Speedup ChArUco by avoiding temporary copies [#27820](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27820)
    - Fixed stack-use-after-scope errors in charuco detector [#28285](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28285)
    - Used fast-path with INTER_LINEAR resize when ALGO_HINT_APPROX is used in HOG 27706

- DNN module:
    - Added more layers support: ONNX randomNormalLike [#28164](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28164), TFLite Minimum [#28248](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28248), Maximum [#28171](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28171)
    - Allowed protobuffer message to be compiled with LITE_RUNTIME [#27960](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27960)
    - Fixed ONNX Convolution node parsing when kernel size is implicit [#28282](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28282)
    - Fixed Windograd flag handling in convolution layer [#28000](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28000)
    - Added NEON intrinsics implementation of fastGEMM1T function [#27785](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27785)
    - Add SVE optimized fastGEMM1T function and SVE dispatch [#28055](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28055)
    - Fixed heap-buffer-overflow in DNN NaryEltwiseLayer [#28272](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28272)
    - Improved performance of softmax_3d with loop unrolling [#27777](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27777)

- Calib3d module:
    - Added estimateTranslation2D() [#27950](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27950)
    - Replaced Gao P3P with Ding P3P algorithm [#27736](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27736)
    - Added QR decomposition option to stereoCalibrate [#27920](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27920)
    - Improved fisheye::undistortPoints convergence [#27993](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27993)
    - Fixed invalid memory access in USAC [#27865](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27865)
    - Fixed out of bounds in calibrateAndNormalizePointsPnP [#28009](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28009)

- Stitching module:
    - Fixed multiband blender memory leak 27333 [#28085](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28085)
    - Pass warp parameters by value to avoid CUDA constant races [#28118](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28118)
    - Optimized fast.cpp on Windows ARM with loop unrolling [#27642](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27642)

- HighGUI module:
    - Fixed linking for HighGUI against Qt 6.9 and newer [#27908](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27908)
    - Fixed Qt HighGUI lifecycle issue when external QApplication exists [#28312](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28312)
    - Fixed memory leak in `CvWindow` Qt back-end [#28102](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28102)

- G-API module:
    - Added G-API custom stream sources in Python [#27276](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27276)
    - Implemented `cfgEnsureNamedTensors` option to OpenVINO Params [#27549](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27549)
    - Implemented `cfgClampOutputs` option to OpenVINO Params [#27600](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27600)
    - Renamed `WorkloadType::notify()` -&gt; `WorkloadType::set()` [#28299](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28299)
    - Added support to set workload type dynamically in both OpenVINO and ONNX OVEP [#27460](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27460)
    - Fixed null pointer dereference in G-API stateful kernels [#28137](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28137)
    - Updated deprecated ov::element::undefined [#28127](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28127)

- Video module:
    - Added multichannel support for findTransformECC and computeECC [#27524](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27524)
    - Add optional template mask for findTransformECC [#27952](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27952)
    - Added optional Known Foreground Mask for Background Subtractors [#27810](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27810)
    - Add setCoarsestScale to DISOpticalFlow [#28217](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28217)
    - Fixed potential pointer overflow in Farnback optical flow [#28226](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28226)

- ML module:
    - Fixed `ml::KDTree::findNearest` [#27915](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27915)

- Photo module:
    - Added 16U and 32F support in merge functions in photo module [#28168](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28168)

- JavaScript bindings:
    - Added option to wrap opencv_contrib into JS too [#27828](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27828)
    - Fixed string property bindings in JS generator [#27726](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27726)
    - Update helpers.js to include .delete [#27613](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27613)
    - Added deep copy behavior for Mat.clone() [#28216](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28216)
    - Removed deprecated DEMANGLE_SUPPORT option
    - Tuned CONV_NR_FP32 size for WASM [#27773](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27773)
    - Added large scalar kernel for fastconv [#27723](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27723)
    - Fixed generation when returned class and function are in a namespace [#27963](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27963)
    - Fixed JS bindings for namespaced `Ptr` factory return types [#28143](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28143)

- Python bindings:
    - Tuned Python bindings for logging [#27812](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27812)
    - Marked Feature2D.detectAndCompute mask as optional in Python type stubs [#27544](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27544)
    - Marked distCoeffs/R/D as optional in calib3d functions [#27564](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27564)
    - Added DLPACK support [#27581](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27581), [#27861](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27861)
    - Fixed memory leaks in pybindings [#27738](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27738)
    - Add PathLike type hints for args annotated with CV_WRAP_FILE_PATH [#27767](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27767)
    - Fixed memory leak in pyopencv_to for path-like objects [#28047](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28047)
    - Tunned Python bindings: use export_name as resolved typename for AliasTypeNode [#27997](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27997)
    - python: fix pytest-cov false warnings by using compile() with full file path in exec_file_wrapper [#28093](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28093)
    - Fixed python scalar typing issues [#27620](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27620)
    - Fixed bug in `ifdef` state machine in header parser for bindings [#27393](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27393)
    - Wrap GridType field in `cv::findCirclesGrid` parameters structure [#27689](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27689)

- Java bindings:
    - Introduced option to generate Java code with new Cleaners interface or old finalize() [#28159](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28159)
    - Enabled Java wrapper generation for Vec4i [#27567](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27567)
    - Added Java wrapper support for List&lt;List&lt;Mat&gt;&gt; [#27705](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27705), [#27708](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27708)

- Applications and Tools:
    - Improved interactive calibration tool: added option to select camera backend [#27546](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27546), extended calibration flags [#27574](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27574), Improved preview for grayscale cameras [#27628](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27628).
    - Aligned calibration tools and samples output fields to make them reusable in further steps [#27872](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27872)
    - Used calibration board imperfectness correction only for the cases where it's applicable [#27571](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27571)
    - Added option to define Aruco index offset in pattern generator [#27799](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27799)
    - Moved pattern generator to apps and rewrote tutorial [#27833](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27833)
    - Fix charuco_board_pattern in generate_pattern.py [#27876](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27876)
    - Updated Tutorial PSNR for identical images [#27859](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27859)

- Build:
    - Integrated KleidiCV version 0.7 with Mac and Linux support (enabled by default) [#28220](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28220), [#27640](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27640), [#27607](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27607).
    - Integrated IPP ICV with AWX512 support.
    - Fixed issues identified by PVS Studio [#28167](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28167), [#28185](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28185), [#28198](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28198)
    - Added support MS Visual Studio 2026 support [#28013](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28013)
    - Added CUDA 13.0 support [#27636](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27636), [#27668](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27668), [#27537](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27537). Fixed compatibility issues with modern CUDA: [#27522](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27522), [#27734](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27734), [#27889](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27889), [#27949](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27949)
    - Fixed OpenBLAS detection [#27778](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27778), [#28052](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28052)
    - Added reproducible builds support by making host system version optional [#27979](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27979)
    - Fixed build issue with some old GCC versions [#27569](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27569)
    - Fixed unicode tracing symbols with QT [#28128](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/28128)
    - Fixed eigen diagnostics for versions after v3.4.0 [#27536](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27536)
    - Added CMake define option to enforce IPP calls in IPP HAL [#27925](https://github.com/opencv/opencv/issues/27925)


      </releaseNotes>
